  "stageId": "main_04-01",
  "title": "免費擁抱",
  "storyCode": "4-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "194fa863fab80e3be8a982ee10b0c8afbbed26f6bbd43870bbeb517c47f3d102",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十一（后）\n6:03 p.m. \\ 多雲 \\ 能見度 19公里\n龍門外荒漠 \\ 14號設施"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......已經到達目標地點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "沒有發現其它異常情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "報告完畢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "霜葉......你一路上，怎麼總是皺著眉頭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "我只是有點在意阿米婭她們的狀況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "阿米婭她們已經順利回到羅德島了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "臨光和杜賓一個星期前就已經動身前往龍門外的其他地區。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "同時出動她們兩個，應該也是挺艱難的任務。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "黑鋼和企鵝物流也有自己的事情要處理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "啊，雷蛇姐和芙蘭卡姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "她們，她們平安就好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "你可也要好好加油才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "芙蘭卡把你交到我手上的時候，可是跟我說她很看好你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "真......真的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "她說，前提是你別那麼怕生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......別突然就一副要哭出來的樣子呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "你不是黑鋼的一員嗎......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "我，我沒有......沒有在哭......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......不管怎麼說，先繼續任務吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "我們接下來的任務，就是和各個偵察小隊一同，偵察這座廢城的各個區域。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "除了搜救倖存者之外，還需要勘察一下狀況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "如果出現了感染者問題，必須速戰速決。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "雖然不是什麼特別危險的任務，但也得小心謹慎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "萬一和整合運動有關的話，就將必要資訊通知凱爾希醫生並撤退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "嗯，嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "瞭解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "接下來......該是我們認真工作的時候了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6:12 p.m. \\ 多雲 \\ 能見度 19公里\n羅德島\n廢棄移動城市區塊-\"14號設施\"被發現後 第2天"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "啊......博士，你來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "來得剛好，Dr.{@nickname}。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "我們這邊的工作也做的差不多了，得暫時離開一段時間~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "要走了嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......知道了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我會想你們的。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雷蛇",
          "text": "很快就能再見面的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
          "text": "只要過一小段時間，我們就能回到羅德島重新待命。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
          "text": "不要太想我哦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "能天使",
          "text": "唉唉，可惜可惜，我們這邊沒有那樣的正經理由呢，德克薩斯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
          "text": "你給我等等......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "能天使",
          "text": "企鵝物流，馬上要回去休假囉！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "能天使",
          "text": "雖然只有寶貴的一天，但是！但是——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
          "text": "......抱歉。不是適合在這種場合說的東西。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "不會......休息也是必要的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
          "text": "......這句話，應該是我說給你聽。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "能天使",
          "text": "沒錯沒錯。阿米婭，你啊，也該好好休息一下了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "羅德島還有必須要處理的事情......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雷蛇",
          "text": "我能理解，但是阿米婭，你可不能給自己太多壓力。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
          "text": "即使信念強大，一直勞累下去，身體也會承受不住的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
          "text": "你可不能病倒了，大家都指望著你呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我......一直受到大家的關照。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
          "text": "但你戰鬥的身姿也鼓勵了大家。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
          "text": "不論如何，這就夠了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "能天使",
          "text": "趁這個機會，我要去羅德島做個免費的身體檢查，然後再回去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
          "text": "我們的任務也差不多結束了。接下來......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
          "text": "阿米婭，{@nickname}博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "——？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我在聽。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蘭卡&能天使",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蘭卡&能天使",
          "text": "加油~&Cheer up !",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "啊......啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雷蛇",
          "text": "彙報結束之後，我們會立即返回。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
          "text": "無論如何，之後的生活，還要繼續。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
          "text": "阿米婭，保重。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "大家......我......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......好。請多保重。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "下次再見。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我得再去龍門外圍的貧民區看看。應該能幫上忙。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一個人去不要緊嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "會不會很危險......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "阿米婭，我陪你吧？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "沒事的，博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "隸屬羅德島的幹員，紅，正在龍門執行其他任務。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "她很厲害的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "有她在，你可以放心。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
